Russian wake words (slushai_dom, privet_dom)
---------------------------------------------
"Слушай, дом" and "Привет, дом" are our own models, trained by Lukaps in 2026
with the microWakeWord training code (Apache License 2.0, Open Home Foundation).
They are not part of the Open Home Foundation collection above. Training used
only material that allows commercial use:
- Russian speech from Mozilla Common Voice 17.0 (CC0 1.0), used as voice
  references and as negative speech.
- Spoken samples made with Qwen3-TTS and MOSS-TTS-Nano (Apache License 2.0),
  checked with OpenAI Whisper (MIT License).
- LibriSpeech (CC BY 4.0), Panayotov et al., ICASSP 2015.
- MUSAN noise, music and speech (CC BY, CC BY-SA or public domain per file;
  tracks marked NoDerivs were left out), Snyder, Chen and Povey,
  arXiv:1510.08484.
- Simulated room impulse responses from OpenSLR RIRS_NOISES (Apache License
  2.0), Ko et al., ICASSP 2017.
- Russian YouTube speech from YODAS (CC BY 3.0; videos their creators
  licensed CC BY), Li et al., "YODAS: YouTube-Oriented Dataset for Audio and
  Speech", ASRU 2023, https://huggingface.co/datasets/espnet/yodas
